{"title":"设置页里有“保存”“取消修改”“删除账号”和“重设密码”。哪些应该做成按钮？","html":"<main><div class=\"practice-page practice-question practice-term-button\"><div class=\"practice-question-layout\"><section class=\"practice-answer-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"practice-question-title\"><h1 id=\"practice-question-title\">设置页里有“保存”“取消修改”“删除账号”和“重设密码”。哪些应该做成按钮？</h1><fieldset class=\"practice-options\"><legend class=\"sr-only\">你会怎么处理？</legend><button class=\"practice-option\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span>A</span><b>四项都做成相同样式的按钮，并排放在一起</b></button><button class=\"practice-option\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span>B</span><b>保存、取消修改、删除用按钮；重设密码用链接</b></button><button class=\"practice-option\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span>C</span><b>保存和删除用按钮；取消修改和重设密码都用链接</b></button></fieldset></section><section class=\"practice-detail-column\" aria-label=\"对应术语详情\"><header class=\"practice-run-head\"><div class=\"practice-loop-copy\"><span>第 1 题</span></div><div class=\"practice-scope-picker\"><span id=\"_R_2cppbsnmivb_\">练习方向</span><div class=\"practice-scope-select\"><button aria-controls=\"_R_2cppbsnmivbH2_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_2cppbsnmivb_ _R_2cppbsnmivbH1_\" class=\"practice-scope-trigger\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"practice-scope-value\" id=\"_R_2cppbsnmivbH1_\">全部方向（334）</span><i class=\"practice-scope-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></div></div></header><div class=\"practice-term-panel is-locked\"><div class=\"practice-detail-lock\"><i class=\"ti ti-eye-off\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>答对后查看完整术语详情</span></div></div></section></div></div></main>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/practice"}